  "title": {
   "en": "DT Tensei ~30-sai Made Doutei de Tensei Shitara, Shijou Saikyou no Mahoutsukai ni Narimashita~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ＤＴ転生　～３０歳まで童貞で転生したら、史上最強の魔法使いになりました！～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Male Virgin Reincarnation: When I Reincarnated after Staying a Virgin until I Turned 30, I became History's Strongest Magician"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Amatsuka Kouta, a 30-year-old convenience store clerk who has never had a girlfriend, is reincarnated in another world after being hit by a car. Midland regularly summons people from other worlds, searching for a savior with powerful \"magi.\" Kouta was initially thought to be the weakest person summoned, but when he turns age 30 while still a virgin, his \"magi\" suddenly awakens. Kouta discovers that he has the same \"magi\" as the legendary wizard Lord Astron, after he ends up living with the Archibald family, an aristocrat in a remote area...",
   "ja": "コンビニ店員・コウタ（３０）は、ロクな恋愛経験もないまま、交通事故死してしまう。そして目を覚ますと、そこは異世界…！！かくして、コウタの愛と冒険の日々が始まるのであった！！文芸界から異世界へ殴り込み！ 石田衣良が、異世界原作をまさかの描き下ろし！"
  },
